The [[Spiked Shield]] is a [[Shield]] obtained by combining the [[Wooden Buckler]] and the [[Walrus Tusk]]. It blocks more damage than the [[Wooden Buckler]] and also gives a {{icon/spikes}} on-block, up to 5, making it useful both defensively and offensively, especially in a [[Spikes]] or [[Shield]] build.

The [[Berserker]] can craft the [[Spiked Shield]] into the [[Spiked Wall]] using a [[Spiked Collar]], which, other than greatly increasing stamina costs of weapons and taking up more space, is a superior [[Shield]].
